      "statement": "Per-user profiles live in the LangGraph Store ['profiles'] namespace keyed by GitHub login, holding default_model, reasoning_effort, an optional subagent pair, repository/branch and PR preferences, model-routing/UI settings, and feature flags; profile-editable settings are deliberately split from the encrypted GitHub OAuth token stored in ['oauth_tokens'] so a profile save and a concurrent login/refresh cannot clobber each other's fields.",
